<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Wiggs et al. (1997), Li et al. (2011) & Eskandari et al. (2015) cylindrical bilayer mucosal folding, period-doubling & Poiseuille airway resistance (Mammalian bronchial airway mucosa & submucosa (Bos taurus, Homo sapiens, Ovis aries))",
        "Wiggs et al. (1997), Li et al. (2011) & Eskandari et al. (2015) cylindrical bilayer mucosal folding, period-doubling & Poiseuille airway resistance faithfully reproduces Mammalian bronchial airway mucosa & submucosa (Bos taurus, Homo sapiens, Ovis aries) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2018-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Mammalian bronchial airway mucosa & submucosa (Bos taurus, Homo sapiens, Ovis aries) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 53.2/100, audit 2026-10-19-airway-mucosal-creasing-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2018-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing.py> ;
    schema:about "Mammalian bronchial airway mucosa & submucosa (Bos taurus, Homo sapiens, Ovis aries)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2018-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing.py; output: docs/media/airway_mucosal_creasing_comparison.png; organism: Mammalian bronchial airway mucosa & submucosa (Bos taurus, Homo sapiens, Ovis aries); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 05e3af78f585432603f642410d2578bbd795537fd20203d0ce320ae7253e2a7e; artifact_sha256: 285fff9751c8f0c97332526a96eeb64dc398c77de16a5c3f1529e721754756bf; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/airway_mucosal_creasing_reference.json=de50bdef15ba022d..., datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/bronchiole_mucosal_rosette_specimen.jpg=ecdf9c611a8c6f1c..., datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/paper_citations.bib=dc5cda198aa48e19..., datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/scout_manifest.json=c73a19386245eae3...}" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmps.2011.01.010>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2016.05.022>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1115/1.4004128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1152/jappl.1997.83.6.1814> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-model-fidelity>,
