    pk:evidenceAgainst "2018-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing.py L181–L212: Only 3 analytical m* values without p-values, resistance ratios, or specimen CV metrics <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2018-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing.py#L181-L212>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-chronic-bronchitis-circumferential-fold-mode-number-m>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-healthy-bronchiole-circumferential-fold-mode-number-m>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-measurement-severe-asthma-circumferential-fold-mode-number-m> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wiggs et al. (1997), Li et al. (2011) & Eskandari et al. (2015) cylindrical bilayer mucosal folding, period-doubling & Poiseuille airway resistance — MorphoEval overall 53.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2018-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing.py` (overall weighted score: 56.1/100). The v1 script implements the cylindrical bilayer circumferential mode selection law m* = (R_0/h_m)*(3*mu_s/mu_m)^(1/3) and basic Hagen-Poiseuille resistance scaling R_flow ~ (A_0/A_lumen)^2 across healthy (m*=14), chronic bronchitis (m*=9), and severe asthma (m*=5) phenotypes, but uses a single-harmonic cosine ansatz instead of a nonlinear L-BFGS-B ring buckling + period-doubling and creasing solver, omits the 12-point cross-airway scaling collapse and relaxed ASM negative control, and does not segment the vendored bronchiole histology specimen (`bronchiole_mucosal_rosette_specimen.jpg`). Overall 53.2/100 (faithfulness 47.1, reproducibility 67.6); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 48, Morphometric validation 52, Source and data traceability 74, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/airway_mucosal_creasing_comparison.png: rendered output of 2018-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing.py at e93f00e, image/png, 208536 B, 1428×1177 px, artifact_sha256 285fff9751c8f0c97332526a96eeb64dc398c77de16a5c3f1529e721754756bf (sha256 285fff9751c8f0c97332526a96eeb64dc398c77de16a5c3f1529e721754756bf), spec_fingerprint 05e3af78f585432603f642410d2578bbd795537fd20203d0ce320ae7253e2a7e. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 05e3af78f585432603f642410d2578bbd795537fd20203d0ce320ae7253e2a7e; artifact_sha256: 285fff9751c8f0c97332526a96eeb64dc398c77de16a5c3f1529e721754756bf; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/airway_mucosal_creasing_reference.json=de50bdef15ba022d..., datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/bronchiole_mucosal_rosette_specimen.jpg=ecdf9c611a8c6f1c..., datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/paper_citations.bib=dc5cda198aa48e19..., datasets/airway_mucosal_creasing/scout_manifest.json=c73a19386245eae3...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Evaluate all 4 clinical airway phenotypes including the relaxed ASM (epsilon_theta = 0) circular negative control, plus the full ASM constriction trajectory R_flow(Delta P_ASM) and 12-point cross-species/cross-generation wavenumber collapse (Homo sapiens, Bos taurus, Ovis aries).",
        "remediation needed: Replace the single-harmonic cosine contour with a nonlinear cylindrical bilayer Föppl-von Kármán / neo-Hookean L-BFGS-B ring energy minimizer that captures primary rosette buckling (m*), secondary period-doubling (m -> m/2), and sulcal self-contact creasing across (h_m/R_0, mu_m/mu_s).",
        "remediation needed: Segment the vendored mammalian bronchiole histology specimen (`bronchiole_mucosal_rosette_specimen.jpg`) to extract the luminal star contour, inward mucosal fold count m_obs, and lumen circularity, and enforce runtime SHA-256 verification of all dataset files." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.32e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nelson-airway-mucosal-creasing-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Wiggs et al. (1997), Li et al. (2011) & Eskandari et al. (2015) cylindrical bilayer mucosal folding, period-doubling & Poiseuille airway resistance — Parameter expressivity: 48/100" ;
