    dct:description "Evaluates 3 constricted airway phenotypes (Healthy, Bronchitis, Asthma, L80-112), but skips the relaxed ASM (epsilon_theta = 0) circular negative control, omits the 12-point cross-species/cross-generation wavenumber collapse, and exposes no CLI parameter overrides." ;
